{
  "info": {
    "name": "CCTV Maintenance API",
    "description": "API ระบบแจ้งซ่อม · Backend NestJS\n\n**วิธีใช้:**\n1. ตั้งค่า baseUrl = http://localhost:4100/api (หรือตาม server)\n2. ตั้ง jobId สำหรับ request ในโฟลเดอร์ Jobs\n3. รัน request \"Auth > Login\" แล้วใส่ access_token ใน Variables\n\n**รูปงาน** `GET /jobs/:id/image/:kind/:index` — **502** = โหลดจาก MinIO ไม่ได้; **404** = ไม่มีรูปในช่อง · Collection debug หน้าพิมพ์: `CCTV-Print-PDF-Debug.postman_collection.json`\n\n**อัปเดต:** `POST /public/jobs` — `description` (อาการที่พบ) อย่างน้อย 10 ไม่เกิน **500** ตัวอักษร (400 ถ้าเกิน); รูป issue/fix ตามเดิม; Settings — SMTP (ADMIN); ดู `backend/docs/api-endpoints.json`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4100/api" },
    { "key": "jobId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "เข้าสู่ระบบ (ใช้ email หรือ username) · คืนค่า access_token และ user"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Reporters (Public)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/reporters",
            "description": "ดึงรายชื่อผู้แจ้งซ่อม (role=USER) สำหรับ dropdown ฟอร์มแจ้งปัญหา"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Me (Profile)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me",
            "description": "โปรไฟล์ของตัวเอง (ต้อง login)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Me (Profile)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"ชื่อใหม่\",\n  \"email\": \"new@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"0812345678\",\n  \"position\": \"ตำแหน่ง\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me",
            "description": "อัปเดตโปรไฟล์ตัวเอง"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update My Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"รหัสเดิม\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"รหัสใหม่\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me/password",
            "description": "เปลี่ยนรหัสผ่านตัวเอง"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Users (ADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
            "description": "รายชื่อผู้ใช้ทั้งหมด · เฉพาะ ADMIN"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Assignable Staff (ADMIN/SUPERVISOR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/assignable",
            "description": "รายชื่อเจ้าหน้าที่ที่มอบหมายงานได้ (STAFF/SUPERVISOR) · สำหรับ modal มอบหมายงาน"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User by ID (ADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/1",
            "description": "ดูข้อมูลผู้ใช้ตาม id · เฉพาะ ADMIN"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create User (ADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"staff@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"name\": \"ชื่อผู้ใช้\",\n  \"role\": \"STAFF\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
            "description": "สร้างผู้ใช้ · เฉพาะ ADMIN · role: ADMIN | STAFF | USER"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User (ADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"ชื่อที่แก้ไข\",\n  \"email\": \"updated@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"STAFF\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/1",
            "description": "แก้ไขผู้ใช้ · เฉพาะ ADMIN"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User Password (ADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"password\": \"newPassword123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/1/password",
            "description": "เปลี่ยนรหัสผ่านผู้ใช้ (Admin) · เฉพาะ ADMIN"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete User (ADMIN)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/users/1",
            "description": "ลบผู้ใช้ · เฉพาะ ADMIN"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Jobs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Job (Public)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "province", "value": "สงขลา", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "district", "value": "เมือง", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "subdistrict", "value": "", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "agency", "value": "สถานที่/หน่วยงาน", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "location", "value": "ชื่อสถานี", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "reporterName", "value": "ผู้แจ้ง", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "reporterPhone", "value": "0812345678", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "reporterEmail", "value": "reporter@example.com", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "reporterPosition", "value": "", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "กล้องไม่แสดงภาพ ห้องประชุมชั้น 2 พบตั้งแต่เช้านี้", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "isOutOfContract", "value": "false", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "images", "type": "file", "src": [], "disabled": true },
                { "key": "reporterAvatar", "type": "file", "src": [], "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/public/jobs",
            "description": "แจ้งซ่อมสาธารณะ (multipart, ไม่ต้อง JWT) · `description` อย่างน้อย 10 ไม่เกิน **500** ตัวอักษร · รูป `images[]` สูงสุด 3 ไฟล์ (5MB, JPG/PNG/WebP/HEIC→JPEG) + `reporterAvatar` optional"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Job (Public) — description over 500",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.variables.set('descriptionOver500', Array.from({ length: 501 }, function () { return 'ก'; }).join(''));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('400 when description exceeds 500 characters', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "province", "value": "สงขลา", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "district", "value": "เมือง", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "agency", "value": "สถานที่/หน่วยงาน", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "location", "value": "ชื่อสถานี", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "reporterName", "value": "ผู้แจ้ง", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "reporterPhone", "value": "0812345678", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "reporterEmail", "value": "reporter@example.com", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "{{descriptionOver500}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "isOutOfContract", "value": "false", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/public/jobs",
            "description": "เคสลบ: `description` 501 ตัวอักษร (pre-request สร้าง `{{descriptionOver500}}`) · คาด **400** จาก `CreateJobSchema` — ไม่บันทึกงาน"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get All Jobs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/list",
            "description": "รายการแจ้งซ่อมทั้งหมด (ต้อง login)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Job Status by TicketNo (Public)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/status/TICKET-001",
            "description": "ตรวจสอบสถานะด้วยเลขที่ใบแจ้งซ่อม (สาธารณะ)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Job by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}",
            "description": "ดูงานตาม id (ตั้งค่า collection variable jobId)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Stream Job Image (issue/0)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/image/issue/0",
            "description": "สตรีมรูปแจ้ง ช่อง 0 = องค์ประกอบแรกใน `images` · kind: issue|fix · index 0–2 · 502 = Nest โหลด MinIO ไม่ได้ · 404 = ช่องว่าง"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Stream Job Image (fix/0)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/image/fix/0",
            "description": "สตรีมรูปแก้ไข ช่อง 0 ใน `fixImages` — ดูคำอธิบายใน request issue/0"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Download Report PDF",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/report-pdf",
            "description": "ดาวน์โหลด PDF รายงานการบำรุงรักษา (งานที่ resolve แล้ว)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Job Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"IN_PROGRESS\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/status",
            "description": "อัปเดตสถานะ · PENDING | IN_PROGRESS | RESOLVED"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Assign Job to Staff",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"staffId\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/assign",
            "description": "มอบหมายงานให้ staff · ADMIN/SUPERVISOR ส่ง staffId ใครก็ได้ · STAFF ส่งได้เฉพาะตัวเอง"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Fix Info (assignee only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "brokenPartType", "value": "HARDWARE", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "cause", "value": "สาเหตุ", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "fixMethod", "value": "วิธีแก้ไข", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "note", "value": "หมายเหตุ", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "oldSerialNumber", "value": "", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "newSerialNumber", "value": "", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "fixImages", "type": "file", "src": [], "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/fix",
            "description": "บันทึกการแก้ไข + รูปการแก้ไข (optional) · คง IN_PROGRESS · ไม่รับลายเซ็นผู้แจ้ง · ถ้ายัง RESOLVED ต้อง Reopen ก่อน"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Close Job (assignee / job.fix.*)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "reporterSignature", "type": "file", "src": [], "disabled": false }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/close",
            "description": "ปิดงาน · บังคับลายเซ็นผู้แจ้ง PNG · ต้องบันทึกการแก้ไขครบก่อน · ตั้ง RESOLVED"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reopen Job (assignee only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"ต้องแก้ไขเพิ่มเติม\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/reopen",
            "description": "Reopen: RESOLVED → IN_PROGRESS · เฉพาะผู้รับงาน"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Move Out of Contract (ADMIN/SUPERVISOR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"isOutOfContract\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}/out-of-contract",
            "description": "ย้ายนอกสัญญา (คงสถานะ PENDING ตาม backend)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Job",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}",
            "description": "ลบงาน · ADMIN + IN_PROGRESS ได้ทันที · มิฉะนั้น PENDING ไม่มอบหมาย (ADMIN/SUPERVISOR)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
